    HTTP header names are case-insensitive, so every spelling of
    ``X-Webhook-Signature`` is considered. Conflicting spellings are reported as
    ambiguous rather than resolved by guessing which one the sender meant.
    """

    wanted = SIGNATURE_HEADER.lower()
